# ==============================================================================
# SyncroGo Workspace Root Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# SyncroGo consists of:
# 1. backend/   -> FastAPI Python Service (see backend/.env.example)
# 2. frontend/  -> React + Vite Web Application (see frontend/.env.example)
# 3. mobile/    -> React Native + Expo Mobile Application (see mobile/.env.example)
#
# Please copy the respective .env.example files inside each subdirectory:
#   backend/.env.example   -> backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example  -> frontend/.env
#   mobile/.env.example    -> mobile/.env
# ==============================================================================
